# Coding Style

Use:
- TypeScript
- Next.js App Router
- server-side logic where appropriate
- small focused modules
- explicit types for important domain objects

Prefer:
- readable code
- simple functions
- clear naming
- early validation
- error handling

Avoid:
- unnecessary dependencies
- giant route handlers
- duplicated business logic
- magic values
- unnecessary abstractions
- speculative features

Keep infrastructure code separate from domain logic.